{"answer":{"answer_text":"2019年，国内零售消费增长放缓、分化明显，国产品牌遭遇了来自消费升级、渠道升级、智能穿戴等诸多方面的压力。\n报告期内，公司依托专业制表所积累的精密科技优势和较成熟的产业基础，继续推动精密科技业务发展和智能表业务探索。\n1、2020年初突然爆发的新型冠状病毒肺炎疫情，对行业带来严重负面影响。\n董事会下设的战略委员会的履职情况汇总报告：\n信用风险，是指交易对手未能履行合同义务而导致本集团产生财务损失的风险。","citations":[{"citation_id":"cite_evidence_6261fef599344d49d8ad","citation_kind":"evidence","document_id":"A000026_飞亚达_2019年年度报告","entity_key":"000026","provenance":{"content_sha256":"2c1f6bb5feb9782e3917485610cf13e5de0e98d543ab09c43b7d97b03278c783","document_chunk_ordinal":14,"evidence_chunk_id":"chunk-124ac6c44e75a8f11afa7a53452b6712","line_range":[153,155],"score":"0.67231375","section_path":["飞亚达精密科技股份有限公司","一、概述"],"semantic_tags":["business","rd","shareholder"],"source_markdown":"A000026_2019_A000026_飞亚达_2019年年度报告.md"},"source_citation_ids":[],"subplan_id":"sp_0c09e6f2bfcb1f39"},{"citation_id":"cite_evidence_148774e42aa96960c5dd","citation_kind":"evidence","document_id":"A000026_飞亚达_2019年年度报告","entity_key":"000026","provenance":{"content_sha256":"428a07fddc1d1b708e3081a343fcfb387fbe74be1c9b268113a608de65f244ee","document_chunk_ordinal":19,"evidence_chunk_id":"chunk-23f59e14bbc959a7da0a3dfb9ff8cd7d","line_range":[175,177],"score":"0.64527696","section_path":["飞亚达精密科技股份有限公司","五、培育新增长点，新业务继续保持了较快的增长"],"semantic_tags":["business","rd","shareholder"],"source_markdown":"A000026_2019_A000026_飞亚达_2019年年度报告.md"},"source_citation_ids":[],"subplan_id":"sp_0c09e6f2bfcb1f39"},{"citation_id":"cite_evidence_b8df71f47a7a2a5c9ef3","citation_kind":"evidence","document_id":"A000026_飞亚达_2019年年度报告","entity_key":"000026","provenance":{"content_sha256":"d639c83413d8e5e8ea361a0c1ec8348a123ccfe00875881925482208526adb76","document_chunk_ordinal":50,"evidence_chunk_id":"chunk-96b912fc5b6c4cfe15c8c777997b677f","line_range":[430,434],"score":"0.70810783","section_path":["飞亚达精密科技股份有限公司","五、可能面对的风险"],"semantic_tags":["business","risk","rd","financial","shareholder"],"source_markdown":"A000026_2019_A000026_飞亚达_2019年年度报告.md"},"source_citation_ids":[],"subplan_id